# 3. OPTIONAL ACTING ADMIN FAILOVER

Do NOT automatically promote an arbitrary Supervisor when the Admin disappears.

Implement a controlled:

ACTING_ADMIN

state only if required by the existing architecture.

The Acting Admin must:

* Be an already authorized Supervisor
* Require explicit eligibility
* Have a temporary authority lease
* Have an authority epoch/term
* Have restricted high-risk permissions
* Be auditable
* Automatically expire
* NOT permanently replace the Admin

Normal Admin recovery must restore the permanent ADMIN identity.

Do not create automatic "whoever connects first becomes Admin" behavior.

